{"time": 1766064237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036629409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "休息时间过后你们再次聚集到了大厅，法伽蒂还是那般平静的站在前台后，你们早已各自在房间中投票选择未知的新世界，如今在旁侧的传送门也已经打开，那是个闪着七色光芒的金属电子门"}
{"time": 1766064290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004085003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“哇哦”"}
{"time": 1766064294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766363650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=369A1AFDC1ECE277A288D3AD1F306196.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTHWa0ja9aDXsoC0LA_WAQtrjBpbxiXnAog_woo3Lv8lp7HkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ2TVQcJxCJgIIu0A-oeTgynoCvtmCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMG20KhOhfO9Ftcojw8u4aOuPFb92_hCaBPgrt89AylVUfAYelyAv8QrCbf2-Ds51bw,file_size=167447]"}
{"time": 1766064306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016575670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“此番世界，希望一些顺利”"}
{"time": 1766064317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434868592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来这门和以往的不同？”视线被吸引，打量起那扇门来"}
{"time": 1766064348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775026141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“科技世界....吗”"}
{"time": 1766064363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527353313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“许久不见，希望还且适应探索的任务”法伽蒂照例说着客套话“想必与先前所见的世界有所不同”"}
{"time": 1766064395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209699097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好久不见，法伽蒂姐姐。”"}
{"time": 1766064408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409426885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那确实是好久不见了）"}
{"time": 1766064415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "395989959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（那确实是好久不见了）"}
{"time": 1766064423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871109408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“这次任务有什么要求吗”"}
{"time": 1766064440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998155456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“除了惯例的给你带书”"}
{"time": 1766064460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209563570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“嗯，正如任务面板显示，请多加注意月亮，世间的命运聚焦于此”"}
{"time": 1766064484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003437695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好。”"}
{"time": 1766064500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637743008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "【月亮的异常?】"}
{"time": 1766064530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234709548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“命运吗。。。”#帕特森摸摸鼻子，感觉这沟槽的命运还在追我"}
{"time": 1766064545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998907168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也就是说是探查任务吧。”点了点头“如果要多在夜晚活动的话……也就是说，会是夜鸦的主场呢？”"}
{"time": 1766064605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463235101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“在那特别的时代，夜晚已不再是影响作息的特征”"}
{"time": 1766064621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246881138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“无论昼夜，都是人的时候”"}
{"time": 1766064645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035024822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“摆脱了生理需求吗”"}
{"time": 1766064655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266093824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯.....”"}
{"time": 1766064673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907058623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "法伽蒂没有对这个疑问进行回应"}
{"time": 1766064687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406319013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"听上去和仙仙格格不入诶?\"这时候才开口，转了转自己尖尖的帽子。"}
{"time": 1766064711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194273224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“赛博魔法使也未尝不可”"}
{"time": 1766064765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619045778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“比如钢铁魔杖和飞行喷射靴...?”"}
{"time": 1766064782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830906063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;思考&#93;,file=82-8283a3f88c9822837963c0b2f8a4ea63.gif,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/82/8283a3f88c9822837963c0b2f8a4ea63/raw300.gif,key=29d0f361bdab5718,emoji_id=8283a3f88c9822837963c0b2f8a4ea63,emoji_package_id=240869]"}
{"time": 1766064834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390855922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“剩余更多的就得等我们去了才知道了。”"}
{"time": 1766064836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745055576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不，她只会那个，爆炸……不过这方面应该也挺契合吧”不知道该摇头还是点头了"}
{"time": 1766064847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685355754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“那是个诸神已然陨落的时代”法伽蒂只是淡淡的这么说着“魔法几乎在历史中不复存在，但这不会是永恒，正如诸神统治不是永恒”"}
{"time": 1766064847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597820561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“先准备一下行李吧”"}
{"time": 1766064878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116001090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“诸神陨落?很像我在我世界干的事情呢。”"}
{"time": 1766064896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948379323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#风轻云淡的说出了惊人的话"}
{"time": 1766064916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534620929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“看来魔法会收到极大程度的限制了”"}
{"time": 1766064927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419902609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“不过魔法有着限制，我们要小心些才是”"}
{"time": 1766064991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "303421382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“嗯”"}
{"time": 1766064997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826077637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那怎么办?\"摇摇头，\"没事，除了explosion，我最近还修习了雷暴啦，大雪啦。\""}
{"time": 1766065001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480513494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（那么某两人要带着NPC吗）"}
