{"time": 1766067176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183623024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“毒虫吗，那可有点糟糕，我已经预感到外面会有多混乱了”"}
{"time": 1766067183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514996680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“或许我们该寻找一下本地的帮派作为切入点”"}
{"time": 1766067198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083396233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我们可能得主动接触这些.....人”"}
{"time": 1766067214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473014039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?要和那些家伙打交道吗？\"手里攥着法杖，\"嘶，拿着这个是不是有点显眼。\""}
{"time": 1766067226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064981570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "华刚到小巷口就看到外面的高楼大厦的林立，无数的广告牌依着高楼，甚至还能看到不少偶像以及二次元小人的直播"}
{"time": 1766067238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945339883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#看了一眼大家"}
